You can do it, Peace!

00:16:58.840 --> 00:16:59.810
Goo goo-kuru.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:01.950
Precure...

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.160
That stings!

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.140
Allow me.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:14.220
Precure...

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.760
Beauty Blizzard!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.890
Alright, it worked!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.900
How refreshing-da wasa!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.450
Alas!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.370
Alright, now it's my turn!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.540
Focus, focus, focus!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:28.740
Goo goo.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.120
Precure...

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.620
Happy Shower!

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:40.090
Nooo! Why didn't anything happen?!

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:45.380
Looks like you're out of options-da wasa!

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.430
Hey, Majorina!

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:50.950
Turn me back to normal already! Then I can defeat the Precure!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.830
No, I wanna beat them up-oni!

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:55.540
Ah, quit your whining already-da wasa!

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:58.870
Use my Antidotizer as an antidote-da wasa!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.520
Give it here! I told you, me first!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.370
No, I'm drinking it first-oni!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:08.930
Buzz off!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.520
Give it here!

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:25.010
Alright!

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.870
We're back to normal!

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.600
I'm me again-kuru!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.350
This is your fault!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:32.760
No, yours-oni!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:37.880
If you'd just given it to me...!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:39.650
Well if you hadn't tried to push me off-oni!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:42.280
I know-kuru! I'll use the Fight Décor-kuru!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.400
Look, balloons!

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.470
Hey!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.330
Come back-oni!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.100
I want one!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.430
Well, there they go...

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.530
I can't believe they're <i>that</i> distracted by some balloons...

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.600
Cute, really.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.830
I suppose they<i> are</i> kids.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.440
Ya realize we were actin' like that earlier?

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:07.110
Why am I surrounded by fools-da wasa?

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:09.480
Hyper Akanbe, let's stomp them-da wasa!

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.690
Hyper Akanbe!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.020
Hyper!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:18.480
Let's take this corny witch down!

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:19.120
Right!

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.720
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:42.750
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:50.470
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:54.790
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:02.420
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:06.600
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.740
Precure...

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.790
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:15.060
Burst!

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:21.480
Akanbe...!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:30.480
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:37.510
Let's put this in the Décor Decor!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.300
I was so close, too-da wasa...!

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:49.410
Man, that was one 'eck of a day.{TLC: えらい目 isn't a good thing. Making that a little clearer in the subs}

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.890
I'm <i>so</i> glad we managed to return to normalcy.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:54.720
I dunno, I was starting to enjoy it!

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.190
I didn't like being a baby one bit-kuru!

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:04.160
Still, being able to just play around without any worries... it really made me feel young again!

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:10.010
How about we keep playing, then?

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.390
I'm gonna be it!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.370
Roar!

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.900
Get back here!

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.980
I'm gonna gobble you up!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.170
You're it now, Yuuta!

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.670
Again?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:30.050
The bath's free! Don't let it get cold!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.950
Now you're it, Nao-oneechan!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:44.630
Fine then... I'm gonna catch all of you!

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:46.200
Roar!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:52.280
Oooh, we've got a tough one now! Come on, run for it!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:56.510
Somebody save us!

00:21:56.510 --> 00:22:00.100
Will you kids keep it down in there?!

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.350
S-Sorry!

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:42.910
This isn't good! They're trying to give Cinderella a Bad End!

00:23:42.910 --> 00:23:43.860
Oh no, squeak!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.020
We won't let them, squeak!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:46.870
We can stop them together, bibbidi-bobbidi-boo!

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:48.790
I shall await you at my palace, fair Miyuki.{TLC: "the ball" comes from the cultural knowledge of the Cinderella story, which the viewers either have or will find out about. Keeping "my palace" makes Reika's role clearer, I reckon}

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:51.430
Cinderella! Go wash my gown, dear!

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:53.130
My, that floor is a disgrace-oni!

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:54.830
Why isn't dinner ready yet-da wasa?!

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:56.830
What?! Somebody, save me!

00:23:57.610 --> 00:23:58.870
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.230 --> 00:24:03.740
Find your ultra happy smile!
